# Wave W17-L (Route 101): camp elm — a young camp elm, bright yellow-green crown still slim with youth, full canopy mass with the highlight lifted clear of the turf, on camp turf (ground baked in). The first road’s young trees — brighter and slimmer than Route 104’s flower-road elm.
